        <p>LANCASHIRE HUSSARS LY. v. VOLUNTEERS. A miniature rifle-shooting contest between teams representing the Lancashire Hussars TX. and the F Detachment 6th V.B.K.L.R. took place at the latter's head-quarters, Park-road, at the miniature range. This completed, the return was fired at the Yeomanry Quarters, after which the contestants sat down to a splendid hot-pot, supplied by Mrs. Davies. A smoking concert followed, under the chairmanship of P.M. Sergeant T. Rirnmer, 6th King's, and vice-chairmanship of S.S.M. Howard. The scores were :—At Park-road : 6th V. 8., 251 ; L.T-T.T.Y., 209. At the L.H.LY. Qtnirters, 6th V. 13., 249 ; L.H.T.Y., 254. Majority for the Volun- teers, 37.</p>
