      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-01-04_WidnesExaminer_art0037" n="art0037">
        <head>DALVTY EVENING BL.OtBE.</head>
        <p>A DALVTY EVENING BL.OtBE.</p>
        <p>With New Year festivities the order of the day, dainty and inexpensive evening blouses be- come matters of the deepest interest to such of us as indulge in evening gaieties. I think you will agree that the particular example illustrated in our sketch is rather unusually pretty, and it has the further merit of being realised in mate- rials of moderate cost. An ordinary spotted net of deep ivory. tone is the fabric in which this dainty garment is carried out, and very charm. lug and effective it is. The chief feature of the</p>
