      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-01-04_WidnesExaminer_art0088" n="art0088">
        <head>NO FEAR OF WINTER CIIII.LS.</head>
        <p>NO FEAR OF WINTER CIIII.LS.</p>
        <p>" Within a few weeks I felt quite well again ; I slept well at night, and awoke in the morning feeling rested and full of energy. Thanks to Dr. Williams' Pink Pills I am now in splendid health, and can face the winter without any fear." Damp and cold days are the danger days of the Year, and lay the foundation for many ills such as Bronchitis, Asthma, Rheumatism, Neuralgia, Sciatica, Paralysis, St. Vitus Dance, Kidney Complaints, and Consumption. These disorders have been cured many times by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills for Pale People, which fill the veins with Bich Pure Blood. The only genuine pills hear the full name in seven words on each package, Dr. Williams' Pink Pills for Pale People. They can be obtained from dealers ; or direct from the Dr. Williams' Medidne Company, 46, Holborn Viaduct, London, or post free 2s. Od. for one box, or 13s. 9d. for six boxes. Send for an attractive booklet, "Many Things Worth Knowing," post free, from above address.</p>
