        <p>ISTIERWOOD—VERNON.—December 2Stb, At the Parish Church, Warrington, by the Rev. Canon Willis, Joseph Isherwood to Lily Vernon. ASHTOIV—MONKs.—DecembAr 31 st, at the Parish Church, Warrington, by the Rev. T. W. Barber, Charles Lewis Ashton to Eleanor Monks. In Memoriam. In ever-loving memory of my dear Father, William Owen, who fell asleep December 31st, 1899, aged 71. Gone, but never forgotten.</p>
